From 6fe10e9b76e5caa5b53adedffa2435dd380b0fe2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 13:08:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Return an HTML continue page for custom-scheme OAuth
 redirects.

Chrome Custom Tabs does not follow HTTP 302 to app:// URLs and instead
renders Go's default 302 body (a tiny "Found" link). Native clients such
as Portclos need a tappable button plus an Android intent:// fallback.
